<!--

Verify that:

- Moving a node updates the geometry of its parent way
- A geometry change of a member way updates the geometry of its parent relation
- A geometry change of a member relation updates the geometry of its parent relation

- node/2 changes position
- way/1 changes geometry and bbox (contains node/2)
- relation/1 changes geometry and bbox (contains way/1)
- relation/2 changes geometry and bbox (contains relation/1)
-->

